 *
 * Triggered when a guest tries to open a restricted Mini-App. Renders a
 * heavily-blurred glassmorphism backdrop that dims the Hub behind it and
 * presents a single primary CTA: "Jiyan ID ile Giriş". A secondary link
 * routes to the full /login sheet for Google / Apple / passkey methods.
 *
 * Pure presentational — the parent owns lifecycle. Mounts to portal-less
 * fixed layer so it overlays everything (including the Hub pager).
