 * Sovereign Authority hook (formerly "Premium").
 *
 * Ideological purge: there is no longer a paid tier. Authority is granted
 * automatically to citizens who hold a +777 Sovereign ID *and* have completed
 * KYC verification. The Constitutional signature further confirms the seal.
